<div n="1">         <head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Drittes Haupt&#x017F;tu&#x0364;ck</hi>.</hi><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#b">Agronomie,</hi><lb/>
oder<lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">die Lehre</hi></hi><lb/>
von den Be&#x017F;tandtheilen, phy&#x017F;i&#x017F;chen Eigen&#x017F;chaften, der Beurthei-<lb/>
